  "description": "Utilities for running Avalonia apps on Linux DRM/Framebuffer:\n\t\t\tevdev keyboard (EN/RU, Alt+Shift, CapsLock), on-screen keyboard,\n\t\t\tsoft cursor with auto-hide and pointerover fix, evdev mouse fallback.",
